 * @retval #MCUXCLELS_STATUS_SW_LOCKING_FAILED   if the operation was not successful
 *
 * @if (MCUXCL_FEATURE_CSSL_FP_USE_SECURE_COUNTER && MCUXCL_FEATURE_CSSL_SC_USE_SW_LOCAL)
